@startuml chat_feedback
actor User
participant "Router" as R
participant "ChatFeedback.controller" as C
participant "ChatFeedback.service" as S
participant "ChatFeedbackModel" as MFeedback

'=== POST / (submit feedback) ===
User -> R: POST / { sessionId, messageId, rating, comment }
R -> C: submitChatFeedbackController()
C -> S: submitChatFeedbackService(sessionId,messageId,rating,comment,userId)
S -> MFeedback: create({ user_id, session_id, message_id, rating, comment })
MFeedback --> S: feedback
S --> C: feedback
C -> R: JSON 201
R --> User: response

@enduml
